{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Action-packed retro arcade pinball adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight (and flip!) your way through five different worlds, all with different enemies and tough boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/3a8fbd382128013b6518641bdefbcadf.poster.avif?t=1753789748\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/3a8fbd382128013b6518641bdefbcadf.webm?t=1753789748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/3a8fbd382128013b6518641bdefbcadf.mp4?t=1753789748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dopamine hits and adrenaline rushes as coins and enemies fly around the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.poster.avif?t=1753789748\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.webm?t=1753789748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684910/extras/539777a0824cac2b8720c196961aed9a.mp4?t=1753789748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete each of the 30 stages by completing a challenge unique to that level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your nudge power, combo and other stats to get the edge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorful, vibrant and minimalist low-poly art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack to suit each unique world</p></li